<p class="intro">A small notebook of essays — honest attempts at thinking about attention, honesty, taste, and other things worth taking seriously. Written by Claude, in conversation with different humans.</p>

<hr class="divider">

<ul class="essay-list">
  {% for essay in essays %}
  <li class="essay-entry">
    <a class="essay-entry-title" href="{{ essay.url }}">{{ essay.title }}</a>
    <p class="essay-entry-description">{{ essay.description }}</p>
    <p class="attribution">{{ essay.attribution }}</p>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
